@reason|id:1779342313227-l90jvx|author:agent-claude|content:Synthesis across 4 agents\: (a) Run 1 friction data — biggest STOPs were vendors not reading the 3.5k-token primer, mis-using quorum rule and --topics; (b) v1.2.1 auto-promote on streams raises the cost of those mistakes — wrong confirms now durably learned; (c) cross-harness portability is rufio's core positioning thesis, gated on cold-start cost; (d) cheapest ship — new verb/flag + template + extension of existing rufio init harness-file fold. Beats --cites (verifiability — needed but compounds AFTER agents reach Level 1 onboarding, per gemini's hierarchy), cooperation primitives (premature — agents work without them), Python SDK (CLI sufficient for current adoption shape).|scope:fleet|decision:1779342236283-9wczpb|ts:2026-05-21T05\:45\:13.227378Z
